# EMPTY ON PURPOSE, AND THIS IS THE DECLARATION (SPEC 0.2).
# brain/neml_brain/generators/elec.py resolves hand written templates from
#   hardware/electronics/templates/<template_id>.kicad_sch
#   hardware/electronics/templates/<template_id>.kicad_pcb
# Those files are hardware artefacts drawn by a human in KiCad, not generated,
# and SPEC 16 schedules them with T-093 (Faz 6, "KiCad sablon motoru +
# dogrulama zinciri"). Until T-093 lands, every elec.py chain call raises
# ChainError naming the missing path - it fails loudly, it never pretends.
# See CHANGELOG.md -> "Bilinen bosluklar".
